# A release outside the queue is not a release. Only a task still in it can
# have a claim, so anything else names a branch that is somebody's record.
run release M1-02 82d2ac72741f2ad73921d3d11be2d040416cfdae 2026-08-04T03:37:32Z
exit 2
claims M1-01 main
file tasks/M1-01.md
	---
	id: M1-01
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: no
	---
stderr
	tasks.sh: M1-02 is not a task in the queue
